## 11. Compliance — CISA 2026 Minimum Elements for a Software Bill of Materials

Informational; not part of the weighted scorecard. `warn` = covered only by a declared unknown (NOASSERTION); `unverified` = cannot be judged from the document alone. Gate on these in CI with `--require-min-elements` (skip IDs via `--skip-min-elements`).

| Element | ID | Scope | syft v1.42.3 | cyclonedx-gomod v1.9.0 |
|---------|----|-------|------------|----------------------|
| SBOM Author | `author` | document | ✅ Anchore, Inc | ❌ missing |
| Author Signature | `signature` | document | ❔ not signed in-document | ❔ not signed in-document |
| Data Format Name | `format-name` | document | ✅ SPDX | ✅ CycloneDX |
| Data Format Version | `format-version` | document | ✅ SPDX-2.3 | ✅ CycloneDX-1.5 |
| Generation Context | `generation-context` | document | ❌ not declared (inferred: binary) | ❌ not declared (inferred: source) |
