| Tool Name | `tool-name` | document | ✅ syft-1.42.3 | ✅ cyclonedx-gomod 1.9.0 |
| Tool Version | `tool-version` | document | ✅ syft-1.42.3 | ✅ cyclonedx-gomod 1.9.0 |
| SBOM Version | `sbom-version` | document | ✅ https://example.com/demo/binary | ✅ urn:uuid:3e671687-395b-41f5-a30f-a58921a69b79#1 |
| Component Producer | `producer` | component | ⚠️ 0/3 (0.0%), 3 unknown | ❌ 2/3 (66.7%) |
